			<div class="content" id="post-content-2201330">
									

<p>Sorry I'm getting to the party late here, but in case you never found your answer, it appears a bunch of Coalition dudes essentially took away Able's anger and unending thirst for bloodshed (d'oh Edit because I left out the most important part: and his powers, making him a normal human again&#8230; except he's probably still eight feet tall&#8230;?). In this canon, it was basically a Daevite curse that made him into their murderous puppet, and the Coalition and Foundation set him free in this little tale.</p>
<p>As for the rest, I guess the Coalition didn't want to actually hand Able, his tomb, and Clef back over to the Foundation, but computers made them think they did&#8230;? That part I'm a bit fuzzier on. And then Gears is apparently gonna create the Church of the Broken God&#8230; Maybe. Not sure. Again, kinda fuzzy.</p>

